  "message": "Since your top priority is the sign-up offer, here’s what I found:\n\n- EcoCard: 2,000 sustainability points (redeemable at $0.01 each, or approximately $20), after $5,000 in eligible spending during the first month. However, the listed offer window ended December 15, 2025, so I can’t confirm it is currently available.\n- Silver Rewards Card: $500 statement credit after $2,000 in purchases during the first month. The listed offer window ended June 30, 2025, so this offer also cannot be confirmed as active.\n- Business Bronze Rewards Card: $500 statement credit after $10,000 in spending during the first two months. This is a business card, and the available information does not specify a current offer window.\n\nI couldn’t verify a currently active personal-card sign-up promotion from the available information. If you’re open to a business card and can meet the $10,000 spending requirement, the Business Bronze offer has the largest clearly stated cash value. Otherwise, I’d recommend checking the live application page before applying, since promotional offers and eligibility can change. Are you looking for a personal card or a business card, and roughly how much could you spend during the introductory period?",
